WEBVTT

00:00:00.980 --> 00:00:03.980
<i>My name is Hiiragi Seiichi. 
I'm a second-year in high school.</i>

00:00:03.980 --> 00:00:06.110
<i>I ate some Fruit of Evolution 
in another world</i>

00:00:06.110 --> 00:00:08.480
<i>and got an invincible, OP physique!</i>

00:00:10.860 --> 00:00:13.150
Seiichi-oniichan...

00:00:13.150 --> 00:00:14.560
<i>A little sister character!</i>

00:00:14.560 --> 00:00:15.660
<i>Nice!</i>

00:00:16.920 --> 00:00:20.620
<i>But now a horde of monsters 
has appeared on the border!</i>

00:00:21.540 --> 00:00:25.290
All of the Valkyries are prepared for departure!

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:28.790
Now, Master, everyone, we're heading out!

00:00:29.570 --> 00:00:30.670
<i>It's been a week since then,</i>

00:00:31.060 --> 00:00:33.610
<i>and I predict further trouble!</i>

00:00:33.610 --> 00:00:38.060
<i>Again, what is going to happen 
to my life in another world?!</i>

00:00:40.110 --> 00:00:42.070
Incredible, Seiichi-kun!

00:00:42.070 --> 00:00:44.730
There's absolutely no disturbance 
in the flow of your magic!

00:00:45.720 --> 00:00:47.390
Really?

00:00:48.430 --> 00:00:52.600
Perhaps now you can finally 
acquire the "Control" skill?

00:00:52.600 --> 00:00:57.220
Man, I really couldn't 
restrain my power before.

00:00:57.220 --> 00:00:59.370
It was getting more and more monstrous.

00:00:59.370 --> 00:01:01.160
<i>New skill...</i>

00:01:02.250 --> 00:01:03.870
<i>Here it comes!</i>

00:01:02.410 --> 00:01:03.870
Here it — (˚∀˚) — comes!!!

00:01:04.200 --> 00:01:06.530
<i>"Endless Hell" acquired.</i>

00:01:07.130 --> 00:01:07.910
Huh?

00:01:08.250 --> 00:01:10.380
What's Endless Hell?

00:01:10.920 --> 00:01:14.130
That doesn't sound like Control at all!

00:01:15.060 --> 00:01:20.090
OP... OP... OP...

00:01:16.700 --> 00:01:18.490
A-Are you all right?

00:01:20.090 --> 00:01:22.140
You're working hard, Seiichi-kun!

00:01:23.010 --> 00:01:24.640
That voice...

00:01:24.640 --> 00:01:27.090
Guscle-san! Eris-san!

00:01:27.090 --> 00:01:29.150
Fancy meeting you here, Seiichi-san.

00:01:29.640 --> 00:01:31.150
Why are you two here?

00:01:31.510 --> 00:01:34.120
We're showing this man to His Majesty.

00:01:38.410 --> 00:01:42.780
You're... H-Holy Mage 
Barnabus-sama, aren't you?

00:01:43.150 --> 00:01:45.300
Just "Barna" is fine.

00:01:46.610 --> 00:01:49.420
Pleasure to meet you. You're quite young.

00:01:49.420 --> 00:01:51.600
Oh, nice to meet you.

00:01:52.250 --> 00:01:53.670
Who is this?

00:01:54.030 --> 00:01:54.960
What?!

00:01:54.960 --> 00:01:56.650
You don't know about him?!

00:01:56.650 --> 00:02:01.790
This man is the greatest magician of all! 
He's mastered all kinds of magic!

00:02:01.790 --> 00:02:03.680
O-Oh.

00:02:03.940 --> 00:02:06.620
Wow! It's really you!

00:02:06.620 --> 00:02:09.940
I bought three of your photo essays!

00:02:09.940 --> 00:02:12.530
One to read, one to preserve, 
and one to share!

00:02:12.530 --> 00:02:14.190
He's a hardcore otaku!

00:02:15.450 --> 00:02:20.450
Such flattery won't get you anywhere, 
Handsome Ice Mage-dono!

00:02:20.730 --> 00:02:24.450
Oh my God! You knew about me already?!

00:02:24.450 --> 00:02:25.740
Yes.

00:02:25.740 --> 00:02:28.460
I hear you're quite talented.

00:02:31.730 --> 00:02:34.700
My life was one lived 
without a single regret!

00:02:34.700 --> 00:02:36.770
Ra, oh!

00:02:37.530 --> 00:02:39.720
Are you the Supreme Ruler 
of the Century's End?

00:02:39.980 --> 00:02:41.360
That's from that one time.

00:02:41.360 --> 00:02:44.490
Remember? The former grand 
champion's retirement party,

00:02:44.490 --> 00:02:47.110
where he said, "My life was one 
lived without a single regret!"

00:02:47.110 --> 00:02:50.280
His stage name was... Kiseno... Kisenosa...

00:02:50.280 --> 00:02:53.730
Kisenoso... Kisenose... Kisenoso—

00:02:53.730 --> 00:02:56.240
Come on, I'm so close! What was it?!

00:02:56.240 --> 00:02:57.480
That's enough.

00:02:57.720 --> 00:03:02.060
<i>But what on earth is such a 
transcendental star doing here?</i>

00:02:58.580 --> 00:03:00.710
Oh, I've got it!

00:03:02.060 --> 00:03:05.990
It was Kisenos—

00:03:03.430 --> 00:03:05.990
That's enough!

00:03:11.920 --> 00:03:15.170
<b>The Fruit of Evolution:</b>

00:03:11.920 --> 00:03:15.170
<b>\h\hBefore I Knew It,

00:04:36.190 --> 00:04:41.110
<b>Monsters VS Crazy Guild</b>

00:04:36.650 --> 00:04:38.160
Hey, Seiichi!

00:04:38.160 --> 00:04:40.420
Guscle, too! And Eris!

00:04:40.420 --> 00:04:41.760
Long time no see!

00:04:43.640 --> 00:04:45.630
Long time no bridge!

00:04:45.630 --> 00:04:47.260
Wait, "bridge"?!

00:04:48.310 --> 00:04:51.020
Your muscles are as incredible as ever!

00:04:51.020 --> 00:04:53.480
You guys really are crazy.

00:04:53.790 --> 00:04:56.920
Wow, "long time no bridge"? That was just sad.

00:04:57.780 --> 00:05:01.040
If anything, you should be saying, 
"Long time no sh*t."

00:05:01.040 --> 00:05:03.280
Stop! Kids at home are gonna imitate you!

00:05:03.280 --> 00:05:07.030
Your style as queen is improving, too, Eris.

00:05:08.860 --> 00:05:10.780
How have you been,

00:05:11.440 --> 00:05:12.890
Ranze?

00:05:14.070 --> 00:05:15.040
T...

00:05:15.470 --> 00:05:18.520
T-T-Teacher Barnabus?!

00:05:19.470 --> 00:05:21.300
E-Even if I didn't know,

00:05:21.300 --> 00:05:23.560
I apologize for standing higher than you.

00:05:24.900 --> 00:05:27.750
You're now a king governing an entire nation.

00:05:27.750 --> 00:05:29.300
No need for such formality.

00:05:29.300 --> 00:05:31.810
I-I could never!

00:05:31.810 --> 00:05:35.220
What's the relationship between these two?

00:05:35.220 --> 00:05:37.810
He was His Majesty's former instructor.

00:05:38.030 --> 00:05:40.810
Someone bring Teacher a chair!

00:05:40.810 --> 00:05:42.590
Here you go. Have a seat.

00:05:42.590 --> 00:05:44.320
Hey!

00:05:44.320 --> 00:05:46.250
Stop it with that stuff!

00:05:48.580 --> 00:05:50.670
This is great!

00:05:50.670 --> 00:05:52.110
Great!

00:05:52.530 --> 00:05:56.080
By the way, Teacher, 
what brings you here today?

00:05:57.140 --> 00:05:59.330
It's about my academy.

00:05:57.960 --> 00:05:59.330
Muscle!

00:06:01.340 --> 00:06:04.650
His academy? Does Barna-san...

00:06:04.650 --> 00:06:08.880
Yes, he's the principal of 
Barbador Magic Academy, as well.

00:06:29.550 --> 00:06:32.260
<b>Murmur...</b>

00:06:29.550 --> 00:06:32.260
<b>Murmur...</b>

00:06:29.550 --> 00:06:32.260
<b>Murmur...</b>

00:06:29.550 --> 00:06:32.260
<b>Murmur...</b>

00:06:29.550 --> 00:06:32.260
<b>Murmur...</b>

00:06:32.260 --> 00:06:35.260
<b>Murmur...</b>

00:06:35.700 --> 00:06:40.030
<i>Now just walking around the academy 
gets us unpleasant stares.</i>

00:06:40.500 --> 00:06:43.000
<i>This must the doing of 
Kisaragi and the others.</i>

00:06:44.410 --> 00:06:46.540
<i>I'm worried about our future.</i>

00:06:44.800 --> 00:06:48.190
<b>Murmur...</b>

00:06:44.860 --> 00:06:47.920
<b>Murmur...</b>

00:06:44.860 --> 00:06:47.920
<b>Murmur...</b>

00:06:44.860 --> 00:06:48.130
<b>Murmur...</b>

00:06:49.380 --> 00:06:50.760
Teacher...

00:06:50.760 --> 00:06:56.520
Is this about the Kaiser Empire's 
heroes enrolling in the academy?

00:06:56.520 --> 00:06:57.780
Correct.

00:06:57.780 --> 00:07:00.390
Ever since the heroes from 
another world joined,

00:07:00.390 --> 00:07:03.270
there have been endless troubles.

00:07:03.270 --> 00:07:05.910
<i>From another world?</i>

00:07:06.240 --> 00:07:07.490
<i>Does he mean...</i>

00:07:07.490 --> 00:07:08.500
Your Majesty!

00:07:09.360 --> 00:07:12.780
I bring an urgent message 
from the forest guards!

00:07:13.560 --> 00:07:14.530
What is it?

00:07:14.530 --> 00:07:18.150
A huge horde of monsters has 
appeared in the neighboring forest!

00:07:18.560 --> 00:07:21.040
They are invading Telbert!

00:07:22.200 --> 00:07:23.520
What?

00:07:23.520 --> 00:07:25.290
How many are there?

00:07:25.550 --> 00:07:28.800
Roughly 5,000.

00:07:30.050 --> 00:07:33.050
But all of them are said to boss-level!

00:07:34.400 --> 00:07:36.560
5,000 boss-level monsters?!

00:07:36.560 --> 00:07:38.640
Calm down, Ranze.

00:07:38.640 --> 00:07:42.310
This nation has its mighty 
Valkyries, does it not?

00:07:42.670 --> 00:07:45.110
Actually, right now...

00:07:49.300 --> 00:07:50.640
The border...

00:07:50.640 --> 00:07:53.370
They're literally covering the landscape.

00:07:53.370 --> 00:07:55.600
They're quite strong, too.

00:07:57.600 --> 00:08:02.210
It's unusual for the servants 
of darkness to amass like this.

00:08:02.210 --> 00:08:03.460
That's true.

00:08:03.960 --> 00:08:07.720
I destroyed a number of 
them before you arrived,

00:08:08.370 --> 00:08:12.090
but they keep springing up endlessly.

00:08:12.440 --> 00:08:17.970
Meaning we'll have to attack all-out with 
more force than they can recover from.

00:08:17.970 --> 00:08:18.910
Indeed.

00:08:19.220 --> 00:08:21.270
Let's exterminate them.

00:08:21.270 --> 00:08:24.570
So badly that they won't even reincarnate.

00:08:26.370 --> 00:08:30.250
Louise-sama, the squad is already prepared.

00:08:30.250 --> 00:08:31.410
It's time.

00:08:31.410 --> 00:08:32.990
You're right.

00:08:39.990 --> 00:08:43.290
Oh? The Water God's Rapier?

00:08:43.290 --> 00:08:45.890
Still such a beautiful blade.

00:08:45.890 --> 00:08:47.750
Enchanting.

00:09:00.800 --> 00:09:01.520
Here we go.

00:09:08.610 --> 00:09:10.400
Water God Slash!

00:09:13.400 --> 00:09:14.650
Take this!

00:09:19.250 --> 00:09:20.410
Valkyries!

00:09:20.410 --> 00:09:22.410
Charge!

00:09:36.280 --> 00:09:37.800
Impressive.

00:09:37.800 --> 00:09:39.290
Same to you.

00:09:39.290 --> 00:09:42.350
We might be able to exterminate 
them more quickly than I thought.

00:09:42.350 --> 00:09:44.060
Louise-sama!

00:09:44.280 --> 00:09:46.180
We just received a messenger!

00:09:46.180 --> 00:09:49.560
They say a big horde of monsters 
is invading the royal capital!

00:09:49.780 --> 00:09:51.060
What?!

00:09:51.740 --> 00:09:52.700
His Majesty!

00:09:58.320 --> 00:09:59.420
Behold!

00:09:59.420 --> 00:10:05.250
We've forced the Knight of Swords and the 
Black Paladin to get stuck at the border!

00:10:06.250 --> 00:10:09.450
Meanwhile, Telbert's left empty.

00:10:09.450 --> 00:10:12.000
It'll fall easily.

00:10:12.240 --> 00:10:16.510
But there are still some 
troublesome ones there.

00:10:16.960 --> 00:10:19.470
Hmph. They can struggle all they like,

00:10:19.470 --> 00:10:23.010
but they'll still be as babes 
before our overwhelming numbers!

00:10:23.010 --> 00:10:24.750
That's true.

00:10:24.750 --> 00:10:28.270
Let's enjoy the show as they are overrun.

00:10:28.270 --> 00:10:31.300
All is for the Demon Lord!

00:10:44.040 --> 00:10:46.670
I've been an adventurer for a long time now,

00:10:46.670 --> 00:10:49.140
but I've never seen this many at once.

00:10:49.140 --> 00:10:52.790
And all of them are boss-level, huh?

00:10:54.720 --> 00:10:56.640
Seiichi! Let's do our best!

00:10:56.640 --> 00:10:58.550
Y-Yeah!

00:10:59.150 --> 00:11:00.820
<i>Speaking of Saria,</i>

00:11:00.820 --> 00:11:03.770
<i>how is she going to fight 
while in human form?</i>

00:11:05.430 --> 00:11:07.310
S-Surely she wouldn't...

00:11:08.560 --> 00:11:12.310
Master...

00:11:13.810 --> 00:11:18.820
Master, I'm scared!

00:11:18.820 --> 00:11:21.570
Yeah... I guess you would be.

00:11:21.570 --> 00:11:24.830
It makes sense that fighting 
would be scary, right?

00:11:24.830 --> 00:11:27.830
If we can't defend the royal capital,

00:11:27.830 --> 00:11:32.420
that and that will be all gone, 
and I won't be able to eat them anymore!

00:11:32.420 --> 00:11:34.000
That's what you're afraid of?!

00:11:34.000 --> 00:11:36.810
I couldn't bear that!

00:11:38.090 --> 00:11:43.340
I'd even kick a god to death 
for the sake of good food!

00:11:46.670 --> 00:11:48.350
That's kind of scary.

00:11:50.210 --> 00:11:52.100
Seiichi-oniichan.

00:11:52.710 --> 00:11:54.100
Oliga-chan?

00:11:54.100 --> 00:11:59.570
That's right, Lulune-chan. You managed 
to defeat that giant wolf, too.

00:11:54.100 --> 00:12:00.030
I like this country where 
I can live with all of you.

00:12:01.510 --> 00:12:03.190
So I'll do my best.

00:12:03.190 --> 00:12:06.360
Hopefully my power can help you all.

00:12:06.360 --> 00:12:08.330
Thank you, Oliga-chan.

00:12:08.330 --> 00:12:11.250
But I do have one request for you.

00:12:11.490 --> 00:12:12.500
What?

00:12:12.750 --> 00:12:16.000
Make sure you don't overexert yourself.

00:12:16.530 --> 00:12:17.560
Got it.

00:12:18.570 --> 00:12:20.510
O-Onii-chan...

00:12:22.010 --> 00:12:26.530
When we're done, will you pet my head?

00:12:28.930 --> 00:12:31.520
Yeah, it's a promise!

00:12:32.770 --> 00:12:34.840
Monshters!

00:12:34.840 --> 00:12:38.020
I'll keel all ub you!

00:12:41.650 --> 00:12:45.030
I'll destroy everything!

00:12:46.770 --> 00:12:48.030
Don't destroy it!

00:12:48.390 --> 00:12:52.400
Oh, there they are, swarming about.

00:12:52.400 --> 00:12:58.540
I'll show them my power 
and my big, glorious di**!

00:12:59.270 --> 00:13:01.340
Hey! They're zooming the camera out too far!

00:13:01.340 --> 00:13:03.300
Of course they are!

00:13:03.300 --> 00:13:05.210
Just close your coat already!

00:13:05.800 --> 00:13:08.050
Where'd you come from?!

00:13:09.350 --> 00:13:11.900
I'll make you regret messing with us,

00:13:11.900 --> 00:13:17.060
right down to the marrow of your bones, 
and the marrow of your pelvis!

00:13:17.340 --> 00:13:20.600
They may look bad, but they're strong, too.

00:13:24.190 --> 00:13:26.490
Our adventurer's guild

00:13:26.490 --> 00:13:29.830
is a gathering place for those 
with overflowing desire!

00:13:31.350 --> 00:13:35.330
Greed! Avarice! Bring it on!

00:13:35.330 --> 00:13:41.090
We've pursued our desires, 
despite the constant scorn of the soldiers!

00:13:41.430 --> 00:13:44.360
No one can stop our desire!

00:13:47.090 --> 00:13:48.960
Good grief.

00:13:48.960 --> 00:13:51.600
This has turned rather outrageous.

00:13:54.940 --> 00:13:56.360
Reporting!

00:13:56.360 --> 00:13:59.400
The monsters have begun marching on Telbert!

00:14:00.770 --> 00:14:02.730
They're finally here.

00:14:03.000 --> 00:14:04.270
All right, everyone!

00:14:04.270 --> 00:14:06.610
Follow me!

00:14:08.620 --> 00:14:11.580
Go, go, muscle!

00:14:11.580 --> 00:14:12.950
Seriously?!

00:14:17.320 --> 00:14:21.460
Unleash the pathos of your muscles!

00:14:21.740 --> 00:14:23.960
That is...

00:14:23.960 --> 00:14:27.970
my justice!

00:14:29.990 --> 00:14:32.660
Muscle!

00:14:37.810 --> 00:14:39.980
Why are you all joining them?!

00:14:39.980 --> 00:14:41.690
I need to get going, too!

00:14:41.690 --> 00:14:43.600
Wait a moment, Seiichi-kun.

00:14:44.230 --> 00:14:47.040
There's no need to hurry.

00:14:47.040 --> 00:14:49.490
Just watch.

00:14:51.870 --> 00:14:54.850
Prepare yourselves, monsters!

00:15:08.870 --> 00:15:10.000
Muscle!

00:15:18.010 --> 00:15:22.140
Guscle-san, don't think you 
let your guard down too much?

00:15:23.820 --> 00:15:27.400
I got a bit too excited 
with all the eyes on me!

00:15:27.750 --> 00:15:30.900
Now to refocus and try again.

00:15:32.640 --> 00:15:37.510
100% of 100% Full Power!

00:15:39.980 --> 00:15:42.420
Pure strength that has surpassed skill.

00:15:42.420 --> 00:15:44.630
That is muscle power!

00:15:44.930 --> 00:15:48.300
So that's Guscle's true power...

00:15:48.890 --> 00:15:51.760
He's the Guild Master for a reason.

00:15:51.760 --> 00:15:54.410
Now, you masochistic monsters!

00:15:54.770 --> 00:15:57.630
Writhe in immoral pleasure!

00:15:58.060 --> 00:16:00.260
Let me give you a reward!

00:16:00.890 --> 00:16:02.910
Onirock Whip!

00:16:06.190 --> 00:16:08.270
I'll drive you mad!

00:16:08.270 --> 00:16:10.580
Pink Ranger...

00:16:11.520 --> 00:16:13.780
If you all keep me

00:16:13.780 --> 00:16:17.030
from enjoying my milk play,

00:16:17.030 --> 00:16:20.540
you'll take wesponsibiwity!

00:16:23.210 --> 00:16:25.290
My turn now!

00:16:25.290 --> 00:16:30.050
Take that! I'm spinning more than usual!

00:16:31.850 --> 00:16:35.140
A pervert's attacks sure are different.

00:16:36.550 --> 00:16:39.050
I'll destroy everything!

00:16:42.060 --> 00:16:44.310
That's just impossible!

00:16:49.320 --> 00:16:52.570
I will defend the peace of Telbert!

00:16:52.970 --> 00:16:54.360
Claude!

00:16:54.360 --> 00:16:56.820
Finally, someone reasonable!

00:16:56.820 --> 00:16:59.000
Compared to the guys in the guild,

00:16:59.000 --> 00:17:01.160
the monsters are almost adorable!

00:17:01.160 --> 00:17:02.650
What's that?!

00:17:02.650 --> 00:17:05.330
These guys are way more adorable!

00:17:05.330 --> 00:17:06.830
How so?!

00:17:06.830 --> 00:17:08.590
What?! You bastard!

00:17:08.590 --> 00:17:11.390
Want us to force your gate open?

00:17:12.840 --> 00:17:16.720
The secret art passed down 
within our rose clan!

00:17:17.840 --> 00:17:20.120
Rose clan?!

00:17:20.120 --> 00:17:22.600
Rose Fist!

00:17:34.050 --> 00:17:36.610
Follow me, men!

00:17:41.930 --> 00:17:44.620
That was kind of cool, but...

00:17:51.130 --> 00:17:54.130
My, a Beast King?

00:17:56.780 --> 00:17:58.990
My apologies,

00:17:58.990 --> 00:18:01.890
but I'll be taking your life.

00:18:09.400 --> 00:18:11.220
Rest in peace.

00:18:12.650 --> 00:18:14.620
He's strong!

00:18:14.620 --> 00:18:17.270
As expected from the legendary assassin.

00:18:17.270 --> 00:18:20.900
Huh? He wasn't just an ordinary café owner?!

00:18:20.900 --> 00:18:23.160
Oh, he is <i>now</i>.

00:18:25.940 --> 00:18:28.410
Saria! Are you okay?!

00:18:28.410 --> 00:18:31.670
All right! I'll do my best!

00:18:32.350 --> 00:18:34.420
Only her arm is a gorilla's?!

00:18:34.420 --> 00:18:36.420
One, two!

00:18:41.800 --> 00:18:43.180
Gorilla Knuckle!

00:18:49.940 --> 00:18:50.820
Hey!

00:18:51.190 --> 00:18:53.440
Ice Prison!

00:18:56.440 --> 00:18:59.980
Oh, that's one of the 
highest-grade ice spells!

00:18:59.980 --> 00:19:01.700
Weren't you asleep?

00:19:09.770 --> 00:19:11.580
What do you think of my magic?

00:19:11.580 --> 00:19:14.590
Yay, Ar!

00:19:19.110 --> 00:19:24.850
Anyone who gets in the way of me walking 
and eating with Master has no right to live!

00:19:26.850 --> 00:19:29.030
Lulunelion Shot!

00:19:33.280 --> 00:19:38.880
298, 299, 300!

00:19:40.260 --> 00:19:41.700
Pet me!

00:19:42.610 --> 00:19:45.870
A-As expected from a former assassin.

00:19:45.870 --> 00:19:49.370
Well, I do believe it's time now.

00:19:49.370 --> 00:19:51.370
Go on and die!

00:19:51.370 --> 00:19:53.470
Chaos Rain!

00:20:09.610 --> 00:20:12.390
There certainly are a lot of them.

00:20:12.690 --> 00:20:14.290
In that case...

00:20:14.290 --> 00:20:17.020
Chaos Tornado!

00:20:34.000 --> 00:20:38.480
<i>He's controlling it so it won't hit 
our allies, even with so much force.</i>

00:20:39.260 --> 00:20:42.810
I've still got it in me!

00:20:43.310 --> 00:20:46.260
<i>This guy is quite the monster.</i>

00:20:47.570 --> 00:20:51.270
Everyone! Let's push on and settle this!

00:20:51.270 --> 00:20:53.770
Yeah!

00:20:55.440 --> 00:20:58.040
I didn't even need to do anything.

00:21:01.070 --> 00:21:03.300
<i>Emergency report! Emergency report!</i>

00:21:03.300 --> 00:21:06.280
<i>Another horde of monsters has 
appeared deep within the forest!</i>

00:21:06.790 --> 00:21:09.270
<i>They're all big-boss-grade monsters!</i>

00:21:09.270 --> 00:21:10.750
Wh-What?!

00:21:10.750 --> 00:21:13.290
All are big-boss-grade?!

00:21:13.970 --> 00:21:16.620
<i>The new horde of monsters is 
double the size of this one!</i>

00:21:17.510 --> 00:21:19.980
<i>They're on a direct path toward Telbert!</i>

00:21:23.220 --> 00:21:26.260
<i>Though we were convinced of victory, 
the creeping waves</i>

00:21:26.260 --> 00:21:27.770
<i>of destruction marched on.</i>

00:21:28.330 --> 00:21:31.090
<i>The true battle for the 
future of this country</i>

00:21:31.090 --> 00:21:32.940
<i>was about to begin.</i>

00:23:06.280 --> 00:23:08.840
The castle's baths are 
the best, aren't they?

00:23:08.840 --> 00:23:12.230
The scenery's great, 
and it feels so open and free.

00:23:12.230 --> 00:23:14.480
Hey, don't swim in the bath!

00:23:14.480 --> 00:23:16.880
By they way, are we not 
doing the usual thing?

00:23:16.880 --> 00:23:18.000
Oh!

