00:23:21.580 --> 00:23:24.730
Hey, did Seiichi do anything today?

00:23:24.730 --> 00:23:28.130
Now that you mention it, he was just 
watching from atop the tower the whole time.

00:23:28.960 --> 00:23:30.760
Barna-san fell asleep.

00:23:30.760 --> 00:23:32.470
That's kind of cute.

00:23:33.040 --> 00:23:34.930
Oh, yes.

00:23:35.560 --> 00:23:39.020
The battle against the monsters 
is reaching its climax!

00:23:39.020 --> 00:23:41.520
Then it comes time to bid farewell.

00:23:42.020 --> 00:23:45.150
Next time: "Before I Knew It, 
It's the Final Episode!?"

00:23:42.650 --> 00:23:50.250
<b>Next Time
Before I Knew It, It's The Final Episode!?</b>

00:23:45.150 --> 00:23:46.050
Seiichi!

00:23:46.050 --> 00:23:49.110
I'll be with you forever!
